      rdfs:label "IATA"@en ;
      <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "International Air Transport Association"@en .


###  http://www.cranfield.ac.uk/ontology/air-domain#ICAO
:ICAO rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
